Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Хахахаха!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Хаха... Ха!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Уф! Ах!
