Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Әй!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Қарғыс атсын!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ха... тай!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,А... уф...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Құдай-ай!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ой...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,… …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Уф... уф!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Сәлем...
